title: Customise HyperGSD
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

HyperGSD offers many options to customise it out of the box through [[Control Panel → Settings → HyperGSD|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel]]

If you want to go further, HyperGSD is a highly-extensible platform to help you track what you need to do.
See more options on the [[HyperGSD API]] documentation.